# =============================================================================
#  POISON IVY - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Seductive")        Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "PoisonIvy_Idle_Seductive" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "PoisonIvy_Idle_Seductive" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s, slow and controlled
#    hips   : slow figure-8 weight shift, one full sway every 120 f (2 s), hip pop on the loaded leg
#    chest  : body-roll ripple that trails the hips, slow breathing, counter-rotation
#    head   : chin lowered, lazy tilt, slow gaze drift (lags the chest the most)
#    right arm : confident hand-at-hip anchor
#    left arm  : languid drift 0-92 | slow lift 92-172 | two come-hither curls 166-292 | trails down 288-352
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.
# =============================================================================
